{"id":"651200","name":"五香豆腐芹菜拌洋葱","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/651200/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"两根"},{"name":"五香豆腐","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"一个"},{"name":"红辣椒面","amount":"少许"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五香豆腐，切块，备用。","img":"images/651200/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芹菜洗净，切段，焯水，捞出，控干水分，备用。","img":"images/651200/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱剥外皮，洗净，切片，备用。","img":"images/651200/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜切碎，红辣椒面、黑芝麻和少许盐，放入碗中。","img":"images/651200/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热油浇一下，加少许白醋、生抽和鸡精，滴几滴香油，拌匀。","img":"images/651200/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"调好的料汁，倒入菜上。","img":"images/651200/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/651200/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/651200/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"爽口开胃。","img":"images/651200/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}